    "detailed_description": "<h1>Contact Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085640/extras/22bf4124b17c2e9c209f4ac02e9c6a0f.poster.avif?t=1753775506\" width=460 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085640/extras/22bf4124b17c2e9c209f4ac02e9c6a0f.webm?t=1753775506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085640/extras/22bf4124b17c2e9c209f4ac02e9c6a0f.mp4?t=1753775506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Update Summary!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added 5 new Dream Stones, bringing a richer gaming experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085640/extras/2c661a0a0d4400dfd4cd4513ac02c853.avif?t=1753775506\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New animation sequence playback feature in Theater mode. You can select up to 5 animations and set the playback duration for each. The sequence plays automatically according to the set timings, and the edits are saved automatically.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085640/extras/01b94a07f761ad099e32a281db64a221.poster.avif?t=1753775506\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085640/extras/01b94a07f761ad099e32a281db64a221.webm?t=1753775506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085640/extras/01b94a07f761ad099e32a281db64a221.mp4?t=1753775506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added camera flip setting in Theater mode! Enjoy more visual variation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community items [Badges/Cards/Backgrounds/Emotes] and the OST are now available\u2014don\u2019t miss out if you\u2019re a fan!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a card game lover who has been single since birth. On his 30th birthday, he receives a magic card that allows him to hypnotize girls. In this game, he will encounter new girls, hypnotize them during card battles, and do erotic things with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players build decks in randomly generated maps and use cards to battle against girls. Use different cards to select different parts of the girl and deal damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085640/extras/812053363bd77479e86aa60a325326cf.poster.avif?t=1753775506\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085640/extras/812053363bd77479e86aa60a325326cf.webm?t=1753775506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085640/extras/812053363bd77479e86aa60a325326cf.mp4?t=1753775506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive Theater</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After successfully hypnotizing the girl, you can interact with her in the theater. Change the scene and lighting, create an atmosphere, and interact with the girls to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap